    ('1852d689-56bc-4c64-b2d8-ab91a735a470'::uuid, '625a53c8-209f-4231-bbc0-05edbd1c0591'::uuid, 'CA_0172: seated per https://www.westcovina.gov/177/Elected-Officials (read 2026-09-23), which lists Nickolas Lewis as City Clerk (term ends 2026); the certified candidate list marks him/her the incumbent. Start not researched.'),
